{"id":"n89291-5-7","stage":4,"title":"질리다 · 失色","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89291-5-7-1","ko":"무슨 일 있었어? 얼굴이 하얗게 질렸네.","zh":"发生什么事了？你的脸色变得好苍白啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"일","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"6","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}},{"text":"있었어?","meaning":"可能","explanation":"있다：可能；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"6","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있었어","audio":"/audio/7f1221d9d5431e3ca85b.mp3"}},{"text":"얼굴이","meaning":"脸色","explanation":"얼굴：脸色；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"얼굴","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17183","senseId":"3","lemma":"얼굴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼굴이","audio":"/audio/81669bb10178aa2a65c6.mp3"}},{"text":"하얗게","meaning":"惨白，煞白","explanation":"하얗다：惨白，煞白；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하얗다","audio":"/audio/77a80be38f1ae80d931c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73274","senseId":"2","lemma":"하얗다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하얗게","audio":"/audio/5fa0f47fd28fa1e8bf14.mp3"}},{"text":"질렸네.","meaning":"失色","explanation":"질리다：失色；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"질리다","audio":"/audio/79cfb0b2ef49910bed75.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89291","senseId":"5","lemma":"질리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"질렸네","audio":"/audio/ff5f532d84ad226869bb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"虚指，表示不肯定的事物。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"所处的情形或状况。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"可能","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"存在发生某种状况的可能性或实为如此。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"886ae927b512e2e4","term":"얼굴","zh":"脸色","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3","entryId":"17183","definition":"某种心理状态表露于外的表情。","pronunciation":["얼굴"]},{"id":"77a80be38f1ae80d","term":"하얗다","zh":"惨白，煞白","audio":"/audio/77a80be38f1ae80d931c.mp3","entryId":"73274","definition":"因为冷或害怕而脸上白得没有血色。","pronunciation":["하ː야타"]},{"id":"79cfb0b2ef49910b","term":"질리다","zh":"失色","audio":"/audio/79cfb0b2ef49910bed75.mp3","entryId":"89291","definition":"因为非常惊吓恐惧而变脸色。","pronunciation":["질리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/bb66f127fa17b48982f1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89291-5-7-2","ko":"어두운 골목길에서 고양이가 갑자기 나타나서 깜짝 놀랐어요.","zh":"在昏暗的小巷里，突然有一只猫出现，把我吓了一跳。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어두운","meaning":"暗，黑暗","explanation":"어둡다：暗，黑暗；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"어둡다","audio":"/audio/ced8d3736f75b7c367ac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89860","senseId":"1","lemma":"어둡다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어두운","audio":"/audio/437e6a7b71817e553167.mp3"}},{"text":"골목길에서","meaning":"巷子，胡同","explanation":"골목길：巷子，胡同；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"골목길","audio":"/audio/4f53c0414cdb717447c0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18340","senseId":"1","lemma":"골목길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"골목길에서","audio":"/audio/c6082e5dee99d32aa9c3.mp3"}},{"text":"고양이가","meaning":"猫","explanation":"고양이：猫；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"고양이","audio":"/audio/2c4930ad509e4bdce9b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18779","senseId":"1","lemma":"고양이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고양이가","audio":"/audio/a659c9673b9a892adb5e.mp3"}},{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}},{"text":"나타나서","meaning":"出现，露面","explanation":"나타나다：出现，露面；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"나타나다","audio":"/audio/d6fb8e71960ac8027a14.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62286","senseId":"1","lemma":"나타나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나타나서","audio":"/audio/34e44d0ce6310e3f279d.mp3"}},{"text":"깜짝","meaning":"一惊","explanation":"깜짝：一惊","readings":[{"term":"깜짝","audio":"/audio/b47d1db3113dea645dee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37744","senseId":"1","lemma":"깜짝","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"깜짝","audio":"/audio/b47d1db3113dea645dee.mp3"}},{"text":"놀랐어요.","meaning":"惊吓，吃惊","explanation":"놀라다：惊吓，吃惊；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"놀라다","audio":"/audio/ca0d0655d175ea6cd75b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61607","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀라다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놀랐어요","audio":"/audio/ee94c824e958037cd0f9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ced8d3736f75b7c3","term":"어둡다","zh":"暗，黑暗","audio":"/audio/ced8d3736f75b7c367ac.mp3","entryId":"89860","definition":"没有光或光线很弱而不亮。","pronunciation":["어둡따"]},{"id":"4f53c0414cdb7174","term":"골목길","zh":"巷子，胡同","audio":"/audio/4f53c0414cdb717447c0.mp3","entryId":"18340","definition":"两边有房屋的长而窄的街道。","pronunciation":["골ː목낄"]},{"id":"2c4930ad509e4bdc","term":"고양이","zh":"猫","audio":"/audio/2c4930ad509e4bdce9b3.mp3","entryId":"18779","definition":"一种可以家养的小动物，在黑暗的地方也能看清事物，擅长捉老鼠。","pronunciation":["고양이"]},{"id":"de3915c860a22269","term":"갑자기","zh":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3","entryId":"26797","definition":"来不及想，很快地。","pronunciation":["갑짜기"]},{"id":"d6fb8e71960ac802","term":"나타나다","zh":"出现，露面","audio":"/audio/d6fb8e71960ac8027a14.mp3","entryId":"62286","definition":"原本隐而不见的某个对象露出形貌。","pronunciation":["나타나다"]},{"id":"b47d1db3113dea64","term":"깜짝","zh":"一惊","audio":"/audio/b47d1db3113dea645dee.mp3","entryId":"37744","definition":"突然间受惊的样子。","pronunciation":["깜짝"]},{"id":"ca0d0655d175ea6c","term":"놀라다","zh":"惊吓，吃惊","audio":"/audio/ca0d0655d175ea6cd75b.mp3","entryId":"61607","definition":"因遭到意外或害怕而在刹那间感到紧张或心跳加速。","pronunciation":["놀ː라다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0ac635a26d3516673d8e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.937,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=89291","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"5","sourceLevel":"고급","day":134,"sequenceScore":2.5904,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["在昏暗的小巷里，突然有一只猫出现，把我吓了一跳。","把窗户擦一擦，房子看起来不是更亮了吗？","发生什么事了？你的脸色变得好苍白啊。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["在昏暗的小巷里，突然有一只猫出现，把我吓了一跳。","发生什么事了？你的脸色变得好苍白啊。","把窗户擦一擦，房子看起来不是更亮了吗？"],"answer":0}]}
